OL,3,GNEWSAAncient cave art discovery
OL,4,Asuggests first known humans in Ireland
OL,5,Awalked over from Wales
OL,6,
OL,7,FResearchers believe the first known
OL,8,Fhumans to set foot on Ireland thousands
OL,9,Fof years ago were most likely from
OL,10,FWales, following the "exciting"
OL,11,Fdiscovery of ancient cave art.
OL,13,FDuring the most recent Ice Age, when
OL,14,Fmuch of the British Isles were beneath
OL,15,Fa vast continental glacier, the
OL,16,Fdepleted sea levels opened a "lost land
OL,17,Fbridge" between modern-day
OL,18,FPembrokeshire and the south-east tip of
OL,19,FIreland, around Rosslare.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
