OL,3,GNEWSAAncient cave art discovery
OL,4,Asuggests first known humans in Ireland
OL,5,Awalked over from Wales
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccording to rock expert Dr George
OL,8,FNash, from Liverpool University, the
OL,9,Fopportunities presented by this pathway
OL,10,Fwould have been too good for hunter
OL,11,Fgatherers to ignore.
OL,13,FNow, alongside an international team of
OL,14,Fexperts, Nash has located eight cave
OL,15,Fsites in south-west Ireland featuring
OL,16,Frock art dating back from at least
OL,17,F15,000 years ago, around 5,000 years
OL,18,Fbefore the previous oldest example of
OL,19,Fhumans in Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
